      <h1 class="ed-title">How Long Should I Walk on a Treadmill?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Around 30 minutes on most days covers the mainstream health guidelines. Weight loss usually asks for more, and beginners should start with less. Here is how to work out the right number for you — and how to make those minutes count.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
